    <rigor-reason>Modifies `tests/**` and tags include `testing` → per root §8 TEST-MODIFYING override row, code-review + adr-check at Step 9.5 run UNCONDITIONALLY (binding ≥6 months from 2026-06-26, ADR-038 / spec FR-B07). Authors integration-heavy vertical-slice seam tests for the R2 read/query/participant/auto-threading surfaces + access-parity negatives + characterization guards on the shared email/messaging flows; ADR-038 KEEP-path categories bind (esp. `tests/integration/seam/**`).</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>W8</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Authors test files under `tests/**` disjoint from 081 (docs). Depends on the shipped R2 spine (010/011 reads, 022 11-form placement, 050/051 participant, 070 auto-threading) so the seams under test are real.</parallel-reason>
