  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">`by-regarding` slice: parameterized across the 11 regarding-family entity-sets (≥3 explicit + data-driven matrix), asserts the impersonation + 2-rule filter and R1 DTO shape; a private-thread-hidden case passes.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Filtered `query` slice: one case per facet (thread/regarding/channel/date) + the `participant=` facet returns role-correct junction rows (NOT text-LIKE), including an unresolved-external `sprk_isresolved=false` row; unknown/empty filters degrade gracefully.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Auto-threading slice: all 3 tiers resolve to a non-null thread; per-record default is lazy + one-per-record; per-user master is one-per-user (idempotency asserted).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Access-parity NEGATIVES: private-thread-hidden + internal-only-hidden on BOTH new endpoints; a regression guard asserts a user authorized ONLY by the retired membership-union sees nothing (NFR-03 — no union regression).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Existing email/messaging capture + resolution is characterization-pinned and stays green before + after the 050/070 shared-path extensions.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">No banned patterns (`Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;`, DI-registration, ctor null-check); seam end-to-end tests under `tests/integration/seam/**`; `TimeProvider` over `Stopwatch`; `dotnet test` green; no product code changed.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">NEGATIVE: the harness is EXTENDED not cloned (§11 — no parallel harness); publish-size/CVE unchanged (test-only) and stated so.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

